				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_0">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_0">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="860" height="868" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-11.png" alt="" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-11.png 860w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-11-480x484.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 860px, 100vw" class="et_pb_image_wrap wp-image-69"></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><h2 class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Recomendaciones de vacunaci&oacute;n a viajeros</span></h2></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_0 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span>Cada vez que realizamos un viaje, es necesario tomar ciertas medidas antes, durante y despu&eacute;s del viaje, dependiendo del lugar al cual se viajar&aacute;, dentro de ellas se consideran las posibles enfermedades.</span></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span>El Programa Nacional de Inmunizaciones del Ministerio de Salud dispone en forma gratuita de las vacunas que corresponden por edad (seg&uacute;n calendario de vacunaci&oacute;n) y las dispuestas por decreto (como la campa&ntilde;a anti influenza, durante los meses definidos para realizar esta inmunizaci&oacute;n), para las enfermedades presentes y prevenibles en nuestro pa&iacute;s.</span></p></div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_row_inner et_pb_row_inner_1">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column_inner_1 et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_1">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_1">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><span class="et-pb-icon difl_list_icon">5</span></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><p class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Recomendaciones generales</span></p></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_2">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><span class="et-pb-icon difl_list_icon">5</span></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><p class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Vacunaci&oacute;n contra Sarampi&oacute;n</span></p></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_3">
				
				
				
				
				
				
