				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1NzU5Njg3NTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>El marco regulatorio del Programa Nacional de Inmunizaciones proporciona las bases y ordena los procesos y estrategias sobre las cuales los equipos de salud coordinan, ejecutan y monitorean las vacunaciones e inmunizaciones para la poblaci&oacute;n en forma universal, igualitario y gratuita.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">En esta secci&oacute;n se puede visualizar y descargar Ordinarios, Lineamientos t&eacute;cnico-operativos, Decretos, Resoluciones y Normativas/gu&iacute;as.</p>
<p><br style="font-weight: 400;"><br style="font-weight: 400;"></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_1_wrapper  et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_1 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/marco-regulatorio/">Ver M&aacute;s</a>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_pb_equal_columns">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="921" height="503" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-03-03-a-las-13.59.49.png" alt="" title="Captura de pantalla 2026-03-03 a la(s) 13.59.49" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-03-03-a-las-13.59.49.png 921w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Captura-de-pantalla-2026-03-03-a-las-13.59.49-480x262.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 921px, 100vw" class="wp-image-248925"></span>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_3">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_7">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="732" height="906" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-30.png" alt="" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-30.png 732w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-30-480x594.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 732px, 100vw" class="et_pb_image_wrap wp-image-72"></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><h2 class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Cadena de fr&iacute;o</span></h2></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_2 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MTExNTUxMTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>La <strong>Cadena de fr&iacute;o</strong> es el proceso de conservaci&oacute;n, manejo y distribuci&oacute;n de las vacunas.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">La finalidad de este proceso es asegurar que las vacunas sean conservadas debidamente dentro de rangos de temperatura establecidos, para que no pierdan su poder inmunol&oacute;gico.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MTExNTUxMTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>Los niveles de la <strong>Cadena de fr&iacute;o</strong> implementados en los pa&iacute;ses pueden variar adaptados a la realidad de cada regi&oacute;n. En cada nivel corresponde almacenar vacunas a la temperatura y por el tiempo que se indican.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_2_wrapper  et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_2 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/cadena-de-frio/">Ver M&aacute;s</a>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
				
				
