			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_8  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_6">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_12">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="769" height="859" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-34.png" alt="" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-34.png 769w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-34-480x536.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 769px, 100vw" class="et_pb_image_wrap wp-image-73"></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><h2 class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Vacunaci&oacute;n especial</span></h2></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_4 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_7  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MTExNTUxMTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MDEzODA5NjcsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span><span data-buffer="<!--(figma)(/figma)-->"></span><span>El Programa Nacional de Inmunizaciones (PNI) tiene como objetivo principal proteger a la poblaci&oacute;n residente en el pa&iacute;s contra enfermedades inmunoprevenibles relevantes para la salud p&uacute;blica, empleando tecnolog&iacute;as de vanguardia respaldadas por evidencia cient&iacute;fica. </span></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_8  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MTExNTUxMTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjEzMjc3MTM0NjQsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span><span data-buffer="<!--(figma)(/figma)-->"></span><span>Como apoyo complementario, en el a&ntilde;o 2018 el PNI oficializ&oacute; la estrategia de vacunaci&oacute;n especial, la cual sigue un flujo de trabajo espec&iacute;fico que permite brindar beneficios y una mayor protecci&oacute;n de forma gratuita a distintas poblaciones con condiciones de salud especiales y/o en situaci&oacute;n de riesgo.</span></p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper  et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_4 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/vacunacion-especial/">Ver M&aacute;s</a>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_6 et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_4">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_7">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_13">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="839" height="862" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-19.png" alt="" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-19.png 839w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-19-480x493.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 839px, 100vw" class="et_pb_image_wrap wp-image-70"></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><h2 class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>Registro Nacional de Inmunizaciones</span></h2></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_5 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1NzU5Njg3NTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>Sistema con m&aacute;s de 10 a&ntilde;os de funcionamiento, se inici&oacute; en la pandemia de Influenza AH1N1 del a&ntilde;o 2010. Luego, en el a&ntilde;o 2011 se inici&oacute; el registro de las vacunas program&aacute;ticas del Programa Nacional de Inmunizaciones (PNI), ya en el 2013, el RNI pasa a ser la fuente oficial de informaci&oacute;n para el c&aacute;lculo de coberturas de dosis administradas del esquema nacional de vacunaci&oacute;n de Chile.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_10  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1NzU5Njg3NTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>En Chile el Registro Nacional de Inmunizaciones es una herramienta inform&aacute;tica que otorga al Ministerio de Salud (MINSAL), un registro electr&oacute;nico y nominal de todas las vacunaciones, entregando la trazabilidad de cada producto biol&oacute;gico y persona inmunizada en los vacunatorios de los establecimientos p&uacute;blicos como privados, en convenio con la autoridad sanitaria a nivel nacional.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_5_wrapper  et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_5 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/registro-nacional-de-inmunizaciones/">Ver M&aacute;s</a>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_10  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_4">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1920" height="1080" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Presentacion1.gif" alt="" title="Presentaci&oacute;n1" class="wp-image-246504"></span>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_7 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_5 et_pb_equal_columns">
				<div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_11  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_5">
				
				
				
				
				<span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="770" height="490" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Destacada-sochinf-cavei.jpg" alt="" title="Destacada-sochinf-cavei" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Destacada-sochinf-cavei.jpg 770w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Destacada-sochinf-cavei-480x305.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 770px, 100vw" class="wp-image-245170"></span>
			</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module difl_iconlist difl_iconlist_8">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<ul class="difl_iconlist_container" style="list-style-type: none;"><li class="et_pb_module difl_iconlistitem difl_iconlistitem_14">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_module_inner">
					<span class="item-elements et_pb_with_background">
                    <span class="item-elements-group"><span class="difl_icon_item_container"><span class="difl_icon_item_icon_wrapper"><span class="icon-element"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="994" height="821" src="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-07.png" alt="" srcset="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-07.png 994w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-07-980x809.png 980w, https://vacunas.minsal.cl/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BlueIcons-16-07-480x396.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 994px, 100vw" class="et_pb_image_wrap wp-image-75"></span></span> <span class="difl_icon_item_content_wrapper"><h2 class="difl_icon_item_header et_pb_with_background"><span>CAVEI</span></h2></span></span></span>
                    <span class="item-tooltip-data" style="display:none"></span>
                </span>
				</div>
			</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_6 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_11  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">El Comit&eacute; Asesor en Vacunas y Estrategias de Inmunizaci&oacute;n (CAVEI) es un organismo cient&iacute;fico-t&eacute;cnico multidisciplinario, deliberativo e independiente, establecido por Resoluci&oacute;n Exenta del Ministro de Salud, con la misi&oacute;n de asesorar a la Subsecretar&iacute;a de Salud P&uacute;blica en la formulaci&oacute;n de pol&iacute;ticas, el dise&ntilde;o de programas y la implementaci&oacute;n de estrategias y pr&aacute;cticas de inmunizaci&oacute;n eficientes, seguras y coherentes con las necesidades de la poblaci&oacute;n chilena.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_12  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span data-metadata="<!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoieW5VUnkwVkVzWjNSTDEwenNvVEZGaCIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1MTExNTUxMTMsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)-->"></span>El CAVEI tiene un rol consultivo &ndash; no ejecutivo ni vinculante &ndash; en las decisiones pol&iacute;tico-t&eacute;cnicas que debe adoptar la Subsecretar&iacute;a de Salud P&uacute;blica, en el &aacute;mbito del control de las actuales y futuras enfermedades prevenibles con vacunas.</p></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_6_wrapper  et_pb_module ">
				<a class="et_pb_button et_pb_button_6 et_pb_bg_layout_light" href="https://vacunas.minsal.cl/cavei/">Ver M&aacute;s</a>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div>
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_8 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular">
				
				
				
				
				
				
